WAxUTVPUHHSRDLOYQ3YcHCNEBKAE"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwiMtajqtNeWAxUTVPUHHSRDLOYQ3IcHCM8BKAY",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["座位不多，點蒜味拉麵湯頭溫潤很好喝，而且很熱很喜歡，但吃不太出來大蒜的味道。配菜不是筍絲是木耳。以為是評論裡厚切叉燒但不是也很薄，這點蠻失望的。\n叉燒飯上了後飯竟然是冷的，一點都不熱。肉很瘦沒什麼麼口感。雖然很大碗但整體是冷的真的很扣分。\n最後建議店家把錢準備好，不是先收錢再說：現在沒有零錢找你，等等再找給你。後面要離開還要主動告知說還沒找錢，店員還完全忘記甚至不記得有收錢？？？能理解只有一個人很忙，但這真的蠻誇張的。我點了餐付了錢卻沒找錢，幾十塊就算了還是好幾百塊。\n論餐點整體來說有更好的選擇。服務可能就還不熟悉還有很大的改善空間",null,[0,119]]]],[null,1752726954000000,1752726954000000,"1 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfZEI0aFJCby12c3BGVnFYQ1lhdnlBUQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfZEI0aFJCby12c3BGVnFYQ1lhdnlBURoTQ2d3SXF2dmh3d1lRMUxLVXFBTQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiMtajqtNeWAxUTVPUHHSRDLOYQ_2MI0gEoBw"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11298354278043006394/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhZDFneE9USmFiVVpYWTFob05rMUdRbnBPYlhCdVZVZHNWMWRIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11298354278043006394/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhZDFneE9USmFiVVpYWTFob05rMUdRbnBPYlhCdVZVZHNWMWRIWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11298354278043006394/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhZDFneE9USmFiVVpYWTFob05rMUdRbnBPYlhCdVZVZHNWMWRIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11298354278043006394/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhZDFneE9USmFiVVpYWTFob05rMUdRbnBPYlhCdVZVZHNWMWRIWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11298354278043006394/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhZDFneE9USmFiVVpYWTFob05rMUdRbnBPYlhCdVZVZHNWMWRIWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11298354278043006394/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVhZDFneE9USmFiVVpYWTFob05rMUdRbnBPYlhCdVZVZHNWMWRIWXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["大蒜